# Normalise line endings in the working tree to LF.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts land as CRLF while the index stays LF, so
# every file differs from the repo in invisible ways and tooling that
# matches on exact text (including the editor used for code changes) fails
# to find content that plainly looks identical. Pinning the working tree
# keeps files byte-for-byte identical across machines and in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images are matched by `text=auto` on content, but be explicit so a
# misdetection can never rewrite a photo.
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.svg   text eol=lf
*.mp4   binary